、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in n\">\\(a,b\\in n\\)</span> 为论域元素；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,b/u,v]\">\\([a,b/u,v]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a> 的元组赋值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varphi_b\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_b)\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall a,b\\in n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_b[a,b/u,v]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ (a,b)\\in\\operatorname{BitSum}_n\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varphi_b\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_b)\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall a,b\\in n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_b[a,b/u,v]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ (a,b)\\in\\operatorname{BitSum}_n\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 1.18，印刷页 14–15，扫描页 29–30。这里统计一个域元素二进制表示中的 1，其长度至多对数级；没有断言任意输入的一元关系的基数可由普通 FO 计算。原书按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log\\log n\">\\(\\log\\log n\\)</span> 长度的块编码运行和，本次核对陈述与该构造的证明结构，未逐式重验全部位操作。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"